title: how to do it
pid: 663071bc-9bde-41b3-b4e0-c583e8d70ef5
body: |2-
  Open a metadata buffer view of the node ('skg-view-metadata').
  Go to the node that specifies its skgrepo --
  it's the only child of a node that says simply 'skgrepo'.
  "Rotate" the value, using shift-left or shift-right,
  until it shows the skgrepo where you want the node to be.
  Save that work and exit the metadata view (C-c C-c).
  Now save the buffer.
  The buffer will be rebuilt,
  and the skgrepo change will now be visible.
